# Test output: the XParty suite writes these into the repo root, one or two
# per --run-suite run. They are test artefacts, not work, and an untracked
# file here fails every "tree must be clean before branching" check.
xpartyanniversary-*.prg

# Written by the Xcode capability pre-action. It normally lives BESIDE the
# repos, not inside one -- this entry only matters if someone relocates it.
.mtengine-ide/

# One developer's Visual Studio state; MSBuild imports it after the project.
*.vcxproj.user

# Rules the published repository carries and the private one lacked; adopted
# on export so the union check never drops a published rule silently.
# - build: the Linux CMake output directory.
# - the other two: agent-workspace paths, excluded from the public export and
#   never meant to appear as scratch inside the tree.
build
/claude/
/docs/superpowers/
